,"name":"Acid House","n":1},{"id":107889004937350,"type":"genre","name":"EBM","n":1}],"labels":[],"album_labels":[],"own_scenes":[],"scenes":[{"id":244014661214292,"name":"Industrial, EBM y The Final Cut","book":"Techno Rebels: The Renegades of Electronic Funk","author":"Dan Sicko","start":1981,"end":1991,"desc":"En 1989-1990 quien no escuchaba techno escuchaba industrial: Nitzer Ebb, Skinny Puppy, Front Line Assembly y los belgas Front 242 (Front by Front, 1988), con Chicago como centro americano (Ministry, Die Warzau, My Life with the Thrill Kill Kult, Wax Trax). Detroit tuvo su escena: Code Industry, el único grupo industrial enteramente afroamericano, y The Final Cut, de Jeff Mills y Tony Srock, banda de apoyo del grupo house True Faith (con Bridgett Grace) en Paragon, cuyo productor Jerry Capaldi acabó enfrentado a sus artistas y sembró desconfianza entre techno negro y blanco. Deep into the Cut (1990, Big Sex/Interfisch) cruzó EBM y techno; la última cita de Mills con ellos fue en el festival Atonal de Berlín. Srock los llevó hacia el rock (Consumed, Nettwerk, 1991).","color":"#a78bfa","family":"Raíces: Kraftwerk, electro, funk, italo y new wave","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/TechnoRebels/#industrial"}],"book_tracks":[],"mentions":[],"podcast":[],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":111153219717496,"type":"album","name":"I See Good Spirits and I See Bad Spirits","list_id":235879004384475,"list":"RYM Top — Electronic — Electro-Industrial","src":"musthear","rank":106,"year":1988,"note":null,"yt":"ZXx6uBtjFMQ","scaruffi":null},{"id":47181158313625,"type":"album","name":"Confessions Of A Knife","list_id":235879004384475,"list":"RYM Top — Electronic — Electro-Industrial","src":"musthear","rank":50,"year":1990,"note":null,"yt":"3q-41G1izYo","scaruffi":null},{"id":47181158313625,"type":"album","name":"Confessions Of A Knife","work_year":1990,"list_id":90391435651867,"list":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1990","src":"charts","rank":151,"year":1990,"not